Package: GastroDeconv2FateMap
Title: Pseudo-Bulk Simulation and Deconvolution Benchmarking for Gastruloids
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bastien", "Chassagnol", email = "chassagnolbastien@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Utilities for aggregating single-cell profiles into pseudo-bulk
    samples, annotating mouse genes, scoring deconvolution performance, and
  benchmarking phenotype-guided algorithms on gastruloid differentiation data.
